Spec: Explicit authenticated Windows Agent entry

Purpose:
  Run the authenticated control/data composition with owner-managed configuration rather than fixture code.

Owns:
  ./AuthenticatedHost.cs

Must:
  Write a public bootstrap descriptor inside the private state directory after the local control pipe is reserved, recording current process identity and executable digest for explicitly trusted sample launch.
  Require explicit state, identity, public server settings, independently confirmed server key, verified runtime hash and IPv4 bind.
  Compose server leases, local SDK control, inner data TLS and dynamic publisher/visitor runtimes under one lifetime.
  Support owner stop and cancellation, keep redirected EOF passive, print public local references only and dispose owned components in dependency order.
